      <p>A topic's DOCTYPE identifies its grammar. For example, <code>-//OASIS//DTD DITA Concept//EN</code> identifies the concept DTD. An XML catalog maps that identifier to a local DTD. The tools can then validate the topic without downloading the grammar.</p>
      <p><strong>Time:</strong> about 10 minutes. <strong>You need:</strong> the tools from <a href="/dogsbay-xml-dita-tutorial-docs/start-here/set-up">Set up your tools</a>, and a clone of the repository on <code>tutorial/00-setup</code> if you want to compare.</p>
