      <p>Fetching adds the reference branches as <code>origin/tutorial/NN-slug</code> without adding their files to your working directory. Later lessons use these refs to retrieve images and compare your work.</p>
      <p>Each stage branch also has a <code>scripts/</code> folder. Its scripts are checks for the tutorial maintainers. You do not need them in your repository.</p>
